      "npc" : "Training Instructor",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Training Instructor]\nIf you want to train in a wider area, I'll let you in.",
      "translation" : "[训练指导员]\n如果您想在更广阔的区域内进行训练，我可以为您放行。"
